  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0: .NET Framework 4.6.2 target (net462) besides net8.0-windows; data source contract VirtualADGV.Data (IVirtualTableSource, IVirtualRelationSource) with VirtualSourceList adapter: 64-bit ordinals, async pages with placeholders for slow (remote) sources, windowed mode with a 64-bit scroll bar for sources above int.MaxValue rows (selection kept by ordinal). Deferred vertical thumb drag (row hint while dragging; the grid scrolls once on a 100 ms pause or on release) and optional IVirtualPrefetchList so thumb and minimap load target rows in the background before scrolling (newest target wins). Fix: a theme Thumb MinHeight no longer lets the page button cover the thumb on very long lists. Existing grids unchanged. 1.1.0: crosshair highlight (selected cell's row and column), VS Code-style minimap (marks, selection, search hits; click/drag to scroll; works on 1M+ row virtual sources), built-in in-memory Ctrl+F search, theme keys ThemeCrosshairBg / ThemeSearchHitBg. Fixes: filler-header filter button exception, corner button layout loop, Items.Refresh on Ctrl+A.\n      2.0.0: VirtualADGV.Core extraction with ProjectReference dependency; existing data types forwarded with TypeForwardedTo. WPF drawing, search and scrolling behavior preserved.",
